<title>SWITZERLAND: Zurich July inflation eases, still 0.4 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Zurich July inflation eases, still 0.4 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consumer prices in Zurich, Switzerland's bigest city, fell 0.1 percent in July from the previous month but the year-on-year inflation rate was unchanged at 0.4 percent, the Federal Statistics Office said.</p>
<p>				   July 1997     June 1997     July 1996</p>
<p> Monthly CPI index change   -0.1 pct	+0.1 pct	-0.1 pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr inflation		+O.4 pct	+0.4 pct	+0.6 pct</p>
<p> Index (May 1993 = 100)	  103.0	   103.0	   102.5</p>
<p>-- Zurich Newsroom, +41-1-631 7430</p>
</text>
